1
00:00:00,384 --> 00:00:04,124
You're not working! How would you
like a job in home health care?

2
00:00:05,122 --> 00:00:06,292
(Penny:)Not a chance.

3
00:00:06,457 --> 00:00:07,957
(Bernadette:)-Please. I'm desperate.
-No.

4
00:00:08,125 --> 00:00:10,235
(Bernadette:)-I'll pay you anything you want.
-Okay, then, yeah.

5
00:00:12,296 --> 00:00:14,296
No! Keep your money!

6
00:00:18,702 --> 00:00:21,202
(Bernadette:)I could've ridden
a bull longer than that.

7
00:00:24,642 --> 00:00:26,592
(Leonard:)What you working on?

8
00:00:26,744 --> 00:00:29,124
(Sheldon:)I'm writing an appeal
to the Faculty Senate,

9
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:31,160
(Sheldon:)so that I can move
on from string theory.

10
00:00:31,315 --> 00:00:32,585
(Leonard:)How's it going?

11
00:00:33,984 --> 00:00:35,054
(Sheldon:)You tell me.

12
00:00:36,487 --> 00:00:38,327
"Dear esteemed colleagues,

13
00:00:38,489 --> 00:00:41,399
(Sheldon:)As you may know, I have requested
to change my field of study.

14
00:00:41,559 --> 00:00:45,599
(Sheldon:)My decision to do so is, I believe,
in the best interest of science.

15
00:00:45,763 --> 00:00:48,333
(Sheldon:)At your convenience,
I'd be happy to explain it to you

16
00:00:48,499 --> 00:00:50,999
in words you'll understand?

17
00:00:53,103 --> 00:00:55,173
(Leonard:)It's nice that
you called them esteemed.

18
00:00:56,273 --> 00:00:59,023
(Sheldon:)You're right. I'll take that out.

